# =====HOMELAB IMAGE BUILD=====
# Keep install/build output out of the context so `COPY . .` does not
# clobber the npm ci layer. Do NOT ignore .git or any tracked file.
# webpack stamps `git describe --always --dirty` into the page; a
# missing tracked file (for example .github/) makes that string end
# in "-dirty", which the Mac image — built from a real checkout —
# does not.
# =====END HOMELAB IMAGE BUILD=====
node_modules
dist
coverage
web
.direnv
.envrc
